  "body": "when letting ldap auth create a user, if the user doens't have an email attribute it results in a rather generic \"Missing JSON keys\" error.\n\nto fix I edited synapse/handlers/auth.py and changed `mail = attrs[self.ldap_attributes['mail']][0]` to \n\n```\ntry:\n    mail = attrs[self.ldap_attributes['mail']][0]\nexcept KeyError:\n    mail = \"\"\n    pass\n\n```\n",
